; --- HOOK_A: "I want to earn money." ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.39,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to earn money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.39,ID,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin menghasilkan uang.

; --- HOOK_B part 1: "dengan rupiah yang lagi anjlok" ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:04.70,EN,,0,0,0,,With the rupiah crashing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:04.70,ID,,0,0,0,,dengan rupiah yang lagi anjlok,

; --- HOOK_B part 2: "there's no better time to earn dollars" ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,there's no better time to earn dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:09.20,ID,,0,0,0,,tidak ada waktu lebih baik untuk earn dolar.

; --- QUESTION ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:11.67,EN,,0,0,0,,So how will I earn the dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:11.67,ID,,0,0,0,,Jadi gimana cara aku earn dolar-nya?

; --- TRADING_REVEAL: "Dengan apa? Dengan trading!" ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:13.42,EN,,0,0,0,,With trading!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:13.42,ID,,0,0,0,,Dengan trading!

; --- MASTER_PLAN: "Tunggu tunggu tunggu!" ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:14.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Wait wait wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:14.24,ID,,0,0,0,,Tunggu tunggu tunggu!

; --- MASTER_PLAN: "Sebelum kalian panggil gua scammer" ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:16.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Before you call me a scammer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:16.38,ID,,0,0,0,,Sebelum kalian panggil gua scammer,

; --- MASTER_PLAN: "listen first to my master plan" ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,listen to my master plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.04,ID,,0,0,0,,listen first to my master plan.

; --- STEP1 part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:22.45,EN,,0,0,0,,First, research all the fundamental techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:22.45,ID,,0,0,0,,Pertama, research semua fundamental techniques

; --- STEP1 part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:26.13,EN,,0,0,0,,used by Wall Street traders today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:26.13,ID,,0,0,0,,yang sudah dipakai oleh Wall Street traders sekarang.

; --- STEP2 part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Second, from all the trading techniques I've researched,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:29.28,ID,,0,0,0,,Kedua, dari semua trading techniques yang gua sudah research,

; --- STEP2 part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:31.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I'll pick the top 3 techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:31.68,ID,,0,0,0,,gua akan memilih top tiga techniques

; --- STEP2 part 3 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:35.18,EN,,0,0,0,,that I think will succeed in today's market.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:35.18,ID,,0,0,0,,yang menurut gua akan sukses di market sekarang ini.

; --- STEP3 part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:40.47,EN,,0,0,0,,Third, I'll translate all these techniques into code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:40.47,ID,,0,0,0,,Ketiga, gue akan translate semua teknis-teknis ini into coding language.

; --- STEP3 part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.33,EN,,0,0,0,,Then I'll connect it all to Connect Trade for automated trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.33,ID,,0,0,0,,Habis itu gue akan connect semua ini into Connect Trade agar kita bisa trade otomatis.

; --- STEP5 part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:50.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Lastly, I'll link all of this to a system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:50.70,ID,,0,0,0,,Dan terakhir, gue akan link semua ini kepada sistem

; --- STEP5 part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:54.02,EN,,0,0,0,,so we can run this routine every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:54.02,ID,,0,0,0,,agar kita bisa menjalankan rutin ini setiap hari.

; --- CTA: setup line (single) ---
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:56.49,SINGLE,,0,0,0,,Jika kalian penasaran dengan perjalanan gua ini,

; --- CTA: color-coded like/comment/share/follow (single line, color-coded) ---
; like=pink, comment=sky blue, share=mint green, follow=lavender
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:01:00.45,SINGLE,,0,0,0,,tinggal {\c&H7777FF&}like{\r}, {\c&HFFAA44&}comment{\r}, {\c&H77FF88&}share{\r}, dan {\c&HFFAAEE&}follow{\r} gua di IG ini.

; --- OUTRO part 1 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,With that said, my name is Kendrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:02.64,ID,,0,0,0,,Dengan itu, nama gue Kendrew.

; --- OUTRO part 2 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.70,EN,,0,0,0,,This is day one of my trading series,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.70,ID,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah hari pertama dari trading series gue,

; --- OUTRO part 3 ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.38,ID,,0,0,0,,dan gue akan ketemu kalian besok.

; --- OUTRO: "Peace." (same in both languages) ---
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:07.32,SINGLE,,0,0,0,,Peace.
